                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "There's a lot of misinformation about how the One, Big, Beautiful Bill impacts single mothers, children, seniors, and people with disabilities who rely on Medicaid. The truth is our bill ensures they continue receiving the support they need.\n\nRead the full truth in my op-ed here: \nhttps://t.co/aPImKbuiq8",
