                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "There's a lot of misinformation about how the work requirements included in the One, Big, Beautiful Bill are a \"ruse\" to get people off of Medicaid. \n\nI believe most people would agree it\u2019s appropriate to expect able-bodied, unemployed adults on Medicaid to work or give back to their communities to receive fully subsidized health insurance, like the Kentucky General Assembly recently passed into law.",
