                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Every year, millions of seniors fall victim to Medicare fraud. Here are a few things to know to avoid being scammed:\n\ud83d\udd18Medicare will never call you to sell you anything or call and ask for personal information.\n\ud83d\udd18Don\u2019t give your Medicare card, Medicare #, SS card or SS number to anyone except your doctor or insurers.\n\ud83d\udd18Don\u2019t join a Medicare health or drug plan over the phone, unless you called and asked for help.\n\u00a0\nIf you need assistance regarding Medicare, my office might be able to help. Visit https://t.co/ljOjUhxAP0 or call (270) 842-9896.",
