                "text": "Republicans passed the Working Families Tax Cuts to protect Medicaid for whom it was intended - our most vulnerable.\n\u00a0\nLast week, an audit discovered $800 million in waste in Kentucky\u2019s Democrat-run Medicaid system. Every dollar of waste is another dollar not going to those who need it. The @HouseGOP delivered on our commitment to strengthening Medicaid.",
